>\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h2 heading--h1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Book a Room</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Select a hotel in London or New York, browse by city or explore all hotels.</p>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"room-booking-block js-room-booking\">\n    \n\n\n<form method=\"get\" action=\"https://be.synxis.com\" target=\"_blank\" data-id-prefix=\"room-booking-99bd4bee\" data-synxis-url=\"https://be.synxis.com\" data-current-hotel-id=\"\" data-current-location-dest=\"\" data-synxis-chain-id=\"5154\" data-synxis-config=\"firmdale\" data-synxis-theme=\"firmdale\" data-synxis-level=\"chain\" data-synxis-all-hotels-dest=\"FRD_LON,FRD_NY\">\n    <div class=\"room-booking-block__fields\">\n        <div class=\"room-booking-block__row\">\n            <div class=\"column-span column-span--12\">\n                <label for=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-hotel\" class=\"room-booking-block__label\">\n                    Hotel\n                </label>\n                <select\n                    id=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-hotel\"\n                    name=\"hotel\"\n                    class=\"room-booking-block__input room-booking-block__select js-room-booking-hotel\"\n                >\n                    <option value=\"\" data-dest=\"FRD_LON,FRD_NY\">\n                        View All Hotels\n                    </option>\n                    <option value=\"\" data-dest=\"FRD_LON\">\n                        View London Hotels\n                    </option>\n                    <option value=\"\" data-dest=\"FRD_NY\" data-synxis-config=\"firmdalenyc\">\n                        View New York Hotels\n                    </option>\n                                <optgroup label=\"LONDON\">\n                                        <option value=\"1409\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"12416\" data-synxis-config=\"Charlotte Street_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_CHARLOTTE_STREET_HOTEL_V3\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            Charlotte Street Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1424\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"12420\" data-synxis-config=\"Covent Garden_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"COVENT_V2\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            Covent Garden Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1431\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"56704\" data-synxis-config=\"Dorset Square_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_DORSET_SQUARE_HOTEL_V2\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            Dorset Square Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1433\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"61570\" data-synxis-config=\"Ham Yard_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_HAM_YARD_V1\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            Ham Yard Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1438\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"17965\" data-synxis-config=\"Haymarket_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_HAYMARKET_HOTEL_V1\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            Haymarket Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1439\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"19198\" data-synxis-config=\"Knightsbridge_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_KNIGHTSBRIDGE_HOTEL_V2\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            Knightsbridge Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1441\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"19197\" data-synxis-config=\"Number Sixteen_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"Number Sixteen_SBE\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            Number Sixteen\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1446\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"12448\" data-synxis-config=\"Soho_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_THE_SOHO_HOTEL_V2\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_LON\">\n                                            The Soho Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                </optgroup>\n                                <optgroup label=\"NEW YORK\">\n                                        <option value=\"1427\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"25650\" data-synxis-config=\"Crosby Street_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_CROSBY_STREET_HOTEL_V2\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_NY\">\n                                            Crosby Street Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1448\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"70795\" data-synxis-config=\"The Whitby Hotel_SBE\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_THE_WHITBY_HOTEL_V2\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_NY\">\n                                            The Whitby Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                        <option value=\"1450\" data-synxis-hotel-id=\"45063\" data-synxis-config=\"SBE_WARREN_STREET_HOTEL_V1\" data-synxis-theme=\"SBE_WARREN_STREET_HOTEL_V2\" data-synxis-level=\"hotel\" data-synxis-dest-code=\"FRD_NY\">\n                                            Warren Street Hotel\n                                        </option>\n                                </optgroup>\n                </select>\n                <span class=\"room-booking-block__error field-validation-error\" data-field=\"hotel\" style=\"display: none;\"></span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"room-booking-block__row\">\n            <div class=\"column-span column-span--12\">\n                <label for=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-dates\" class=\"room-booking-block__label\">\n                    Select Dates\n                    <span class=\"room-booking-block__required\" aria-label=\"required\">*</span>\n                </label>\n                <input\n                    type=\"text\"\n                    id=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-dates\"\n                    name=\"dates\"\n                    class=\"room-booking-block__input room-booking-block__input--hidden js-room-booking-dates js-date-time-picker\"\n                    placeholder=\"Select check-in and check-out dates\"\n                    data-enable-time=\"false\"\n                    data-inline=\"true\"\n                    data-range=\"true\"\n                    required\n                    aria-required=\"true\"\n                />\n                <span class=\"room-booking-block__error field-validation-error\" data-field=\"dates\" style=\"display: none;\"></span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"room-booking-block__rooms js-room-booking-rooms\">\n            <div class=\"room-booking-block__row room-booking-block__row--padded js-room-booking-room\" data-room-index=\"0\">\n                <div class=\"room-booking-block__heading column-span column-span--12\">\n                    <span class=\"js-room-booking-room-title\">\n                        Guests\n                    </span>\n                    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--pill btn--small btn--minus js-room-booking-remove\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                        Remove\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"column-span column-span--6\">\n                    <label for=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-adults_0\" class=\"room-booking-block__label\">\n                        Adults\n                        <span class=\"room-booking-block__required\" aria-label=\"required\">*</span>\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"room-booking-block__stepper js-room-booking-stepper\">\n                        <button\n                            type=\"button\"\n                            class=\"btn btn--stepper btn--minus js-stepper-minus\"\n                            aria-label=\"Decrease adults\"\n                            disabled\n                        ></button>\n                        <input\n                            type=\"text\"\n                            id=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-adults_0\"\n                            name=\"adults\"\n                            class=\"room-booking-block__stepper-input js-room-booking-adults js-stepper-value\"\n                            value=\"2\"\n                            readonly\n                            aria-label=\"Number of adults\"\n                            data-min=\"1\"\n                            data-max=\"6\"\n                        />\n                        <button\n                            type=\"button\"\n                            class=\"btn btn--stepper btn--plus js-stepper-plus\"\n                            aria-label=\"Increase adults\"\n                        ></button>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"room-booking-block__error field-validation-error\" data-field=\"adults\" style=\"display: none;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"column-span column-span--6\">\n                    <label for=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-children_0\" class=\"room-booking-block__label\">\n                        Children\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"room-booking-block__stepper js-room-booking-stepper\">\n                        <button\n                            type=\"button\"\n                            class=\"btn btn--stepper btn--minus js-stepper-minus\"\n                            aria-label=\"Decrease children\"\n                            disabled\n                        ></button>\n                        <input\n                            type=\"text\"\n                            id=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-children_0\"\n                            name=\"child\"\n                            class=\"room-booking-block__stepper-input js-room-booking-children js-stepper-value\"\n                            value=\"0\"\n                            readonly\n                            aria-label=\"Number of children\"\n                            data-min=\"0\"\n                            data-max=\"2\"\n                        />\n                        <button\n                            type=\"button\"\n                            class=\"btn btn--stepper btn--plus js-stepper-plus\"\n                            aria-label=\"Increase children\"\n                        ></button>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"room-booking-block__error field-validation-error\" data-field=\"children\" style=\"display: none;\"></span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"room-booking-block__row room-booking-block__row--centered room-booking-block__row--extra-margin\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--pill btn--plus js-room-booking-add\">\n                Add another room\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"room-booking-block__optional-fields js-room-booking-optional-fields\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"room-booking-block__optional-toggle unbutton js-room-booking-optional-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                <span>Booking Code / IATA Agent</span>\n                <span class=\"room-booking-block__optional-icon\"></span>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"room-booking-block__optional-content js-room-booking-optional-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"room-booking-block__optional-description\">\n                        <p>Enter a booking code and/or IATA Agent ID if you have one.</p>\n                    </div>\n                <div class=\"room-booking-block__row\">\n                    <div class=\"column-span column-span--12\">\n                        <label for=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-booking-code\" class=\"room-booking-block__label\">\n                            Booking Code\n                        </label>\n                        <input\n                            type=\"text\"\n                            id=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-booking-code\"\n                            name=\"booking-code\"\n                            class=\"room-booking-block__input js-room-booking-booking-code\"\n                        />\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"room-booking-block__row\">\n                    <div class=\"column-span column-span--12\">\n                        <label for=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-iata-agent-id\" class=\"room-booking-block__label\">\n                            IATA Agent ID\n                        </label>\n                        <input\n                            type=\"text\"\n                            id=\"room-booking-99bd4bee-iata-agent-id\"\n                            name=\"iata-agent-id\"\n                            class=\"room-booking-block__input js-room-booking-iata-agent-id\"\n                        />\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"room-booking-block__actions\">\n        <a href=\"https://be.synxis.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"room-booking-block__submit btn btn--primary js-room-booking-submit\">\n            Check Availability\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</form>\n\n</div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n    \n\n\n    \n\n<main id=\"maincontent\" class=\"page page--event\">\n    <div class=\"list-item-page list-item-page--events\">\n        \n\n\n\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-none section--bottom-padding-none section--width-x-wide section--gutter-x-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--x-wide\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--4\" data-area-col-span=\"4\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:1\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-center group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Firmdale Film Club</h2>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"divider divider--theme-none\"></div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h4 class=\"heading--h5\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Film Club is our weekly film screening series, hosted in our luxury cinemas at Charlotte Street Hotel, Covent Garden Hotel and The Soho Hotel.</h4>\n<h4 class=\"heading--h5\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Film Only:</strong> £25 per person<br><em>Film Club including popcorn</em></h4>\n<h4 class=\"heading--h5\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Lunch or Dinner:</strong> £55 per person<br><em>Film Club including a three course menu or an Afternoon Tea</em></h4>\n<h4 class=\"heading--h5\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Brunch </strong>(only at Charlotte Street Hotel)<strong>:&nbsp;</strong>£55 per person <br><em>Film Club including a brunch dish, hot drink and cocktail or smoothie</em></h4>\n<h4 class=\"heading--h5\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Champagne:</strong> £65 per person<br><em>Film Club including Champagne, a three course menu, an Afternoon Tea or brunch</em></h4>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--8\" data-area-col-span=\"8\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"image-block image-block--fill-width image-block--crop-landscape\" >\n            <picture>\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=1440&format=webp&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=1280&format=webp&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=960&format=webp&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=720&format=webp&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=640&format=webp&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=512&format=webp&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=480&format=webp&v=1db4a608448a1f0\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=1440&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=1280&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=960&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=720&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=640&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=512&v=1db4a608448a1f0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&width=480&v=1db4a608448a1f0\"  />\r\n<img aria-hidden=\"true\" alt=\"Front shot of the small screening private events room at the Soho Hotel\" src=\"/media/izwauhil/the-soho-hotel-screening-room-1.jpg?cc=0,0.07813456559379246,0,0.07812901349079616&amp;width=480&amp;v=1db4a608448a1f0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"image-block__image\" /></picture>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-secondary section--halign-center section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-default section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <p style=\"text-align: center;\">Explore our latest Film Club listings, from recent releases to an exploration of award-winning cinema. Whether you're a film buff, or just looking for a great night out, there's something for everyone. Make the most of it with our Film Club offers, and treat yourself to a meal in our restaurants. Available at The Soho Hotel, Charlotte Street Hotel and Covent Garden Hotel, it’s a ‘club’ in name only. All tickets include popcorn.</p>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"video-block embed js-video-with-facade video-block--poster\">\n        <div class=\"video-block__content\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/rdlOZhl-nSA?autoplay=1\" class=\"video-block__link js-video-with-facade-link\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Click to play video\">\n                    <picture>\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=720&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=980&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=425&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=375&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=960&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=960&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=960&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=720&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=980&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=425&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=375&v=1dcf42c73dc5470\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from the film &#x27;Tuner&#x27;: the image portrays two men waiting at a doorstep, to the left the man is wearing a yellow jacket and to the right the man wears a navy shirt. \" src=\"/media/lashosj2/tuner.png?width=375&amp;v=1dcf42c73dc5470\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/rdlOZhl-nSA?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">Tuner</h2>\n<p>A talented piano tuner with a heightened sense of hearing draws the attention of criminals, who see his talents as a tool for committing robberies. With his once-promising musical career over, he works across New York with his mentor Harry Horowitz and is pulled into increasingly dangerous territory.</p>\n<p>Stars Leo Woodall,&nbsp;Dustin Hoffman,&nbsp;Alisen Richmond-Peck<br><em>(Certification 15)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/oscarbarandrestaurant?default_date=2026-07-11&amp;default_time=3:00PM&amp;client_id=9a6c3c788997f04daa2aae1a162e8ee12ae0fe4d1ded9c6c64b93acd28404dfc0e1b100991a10fc55ba87576a4f367848c29fc5188c6e988e16c14894026d2f7\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2026-07-11&amp;default_time=3:00PM&amp;client_id=9a6c3c788997f04daa2aae1a162e8ee12ae0fe4d1ded9c6c64b93acd28404dfc0e1b100991a10fc55ba87576a4f367848c29fc5188c6e988e16c14894026d2f7\">CHARLOTTE STREET HOTEL - SATURDAY 11TH JULY, 3PM</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2026-07-19&amp;default_time=15:30PM&amp;client_id=334b392641574269400c753af9579ab19a9152c92124f9e6b0d34d6e61fd668976607d491b69255fbeffe8d04c2e2410f25ae236e6ab60aeb6bdbf70367e93e9\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2026-07-19&amp;default_time=15:30PM&amp;client_id=334b392641574269400c753af9579ab19a9152c92124f9e6b0d34d6e61fd668976607d491b69255fbeffe8d04c2e2410f25ae236e6ab60aeb6bdbf70367e93e9\">THE SOHO HOTEL - SUNDAY 19TH JULY, 3:30PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"video-block embed js-video-with-facade video-block--poster\">\n        <div class=\"video-block__content\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/e9HXmMnUEdE?autoplay=1\" class=\"video-block__link js-video-with-facade-link\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Click to play video\">\n                    <picture>\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=720&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=980&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=425&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=375&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=960&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=960&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=960&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=720&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=980&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=425&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=375&v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from the film &quot;The Devil Wears Prada 2&quot;: the image displays an older fashionable woman walking in front of a younger woman and a smartly-dressed man into a magazine office\" src=\"/media/fdsdwjcp/the-devil-wears-prada-2.jpg?width=375&amp;v=1dcf42c73e26ef0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/e9HXmMnUEdE?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">The Devil Wears Prada 2</h2>\n<p>The eagerly awaited sequel to the 2006 phenomenon that defined a generation. Twenty years later, Andy Sachs reunites with Miranda Priestly as they navigate their careers amid the decline of traditional magazine publishing.</p>\n<p>Stars Meryl Streep, Anne Hathaway, Emily Blunt<br><em>(Certification 12A)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/brasseriemax?default_date=2026-07-11&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=5554115ec181cee072e8c10deb6366b45c582b2fcd2411c01a423119b2fa165a2a3697dbfdc17130d6cf8ff1b596bef21e593db4273e04d25f33c9a46b3b1441\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2026-07-11&amp;default_time=8:00PM&amp;client_id=5554115ec181cee072e8c10deb6366b45c582b2fcd2411c01a423119b2fa165a2a3697dbfdc17130d6cf8ff1b596bef21e593db4273e04d25f33c9a46b3b1441\">COVENT GARDEN HOTEL - SATURDAY 11TH JULY, 8PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"video-block embed js-video-with-facade video-block--poster\">\n        <div class=\"video-block__content\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xuggTtSpnyI?autoplay=1\" class=\"video-block__link js-video-with-facade-link\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Click to play video\">\n                    <picture>\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=720&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=980&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=425&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=375&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=960&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=960&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=960&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=720&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=980&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=425&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=375&v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from the film &#x27;Madfabulous&#x27;: the image portrays two people, dressed in 19th-century clothing, and the woman is feeding the man a date\" src=\"/media/ms3jszg4/madfabulous.png?width=375&amp;v=1dcf42c73dffdf0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xuggTtSpnyI?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">Madfabulous</h2>\n<p>When the flamboyant Henry Paget arrives in 1890’s North Wales to claim his aristocratic inheritance, his theatrical flair and defiant eccentricities send shockwaves through the upper-class elite. Based on true events, the story follows Henry’s path in carving out his own identity as the Fifth Marquess of Anglesey.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Stars Rupert Everett, Greta Jones, Ruby Stokes<br><em>(Certification 12A)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/refuelbarandrestaurant?default_date=2026-07-12&amp;default_time=15:30PM&amp;client_id=e376ffe08f61eb1c719854c1eb39efbb25635c23c5b7d8298ea1035b071b6198626acbe27392c5567b90095597e344899c24efcd1316005f95d8195efe3b0dd8\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2026-07-12&amp;default_time=15:30PM&amp;client_id=e376ffe08f61eb1c719854c1eb39efbb25635c23c5b7d8298ea1035b071b6198626acbe27392c5567b90095597e344899c24efcd1316005f95d8195efe3b0dd8\">THE SOHO HOTEL - SUNDAY 12TH JULY, 3:30PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"video-block embed js-video-with-facade video-block--poster\">\n        <div class=\"video-block__content\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/fPQ4RfIYeQ0?autoplay=1\" class=\"video-block__link js-video-with-facade-link\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Click to play video\">\n                    <picture>\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=720&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=980&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=425&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=375&format=webp&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=960&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=960&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=960&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=720&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=980&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=425&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=375&v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from the film &#x27;Virginia Woolf&#x27;s Night and Day&#x27;: the image displays four people enjoying champagne in a living room. The younger couple are sat on the patterned sofa while the older pair are standing\" src=\"/media/uv1n54sl/virginia-woolfs-night-and-day.jpg?width=375&amp;v=1dcf42c73d85cd0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/fPQ4RfIYeQ0?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">Virginia Woolf's Night and Day</h2>\n<p>A passionate astronomer in early twentieth-century London does everything she can to avoid romantic love and marriage. Her bold challenge to Edwardian patriarchy is set against the suffragette movement and advances in science and technology.</p>\n<p>Stars Haley Bennett,&nbsp;Elyas M'Barek, Lily Allen<br><em>(Certification 12A)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/oscarbarandrestaurant?default_date=2026-07-18&amp;default_time=3:00PM&amp;client_id=558a7eec43f71377f32f7807763c1aa19b66e90cd977cff89027d77e35b90521bc8c200139aaaa5557d06a82fa37c99b62476f1de593af078afe11bf26eb8b3f\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2026-07-18&amp;default_time=3:00PM&amp;client_id=558a7eec43f71377f32f7807763c1aa19b66e90cd977cff89027d77e35b90521bc8c200139aaaa5557d06a82fa37c99b62476f1de593af078afe11bf26eb8b3f\">CHARLOTTE STREET HOTEL - SATURDAY 18TH JULY, 3PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-left section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-large section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--remove-decorative-tear\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"video-block embed js-video-with-facade video-block--poster\">\n        <div class=\"video-block__content\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/PugHo6Pm51I?autoplay=1\" class=\"video-block__link js-video-with-facade-link\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Click to play video\">\n                    <picture>\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=960&format=webp&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=720&format=webp&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=980&format=webp&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=425&format=webp&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=375&format=webp&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\"  type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=960&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=960&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 1440px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=960&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 1280px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=720&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 980px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=980&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=425&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" media=\"(min-width: 375px)\" />\r\n<source srcset=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=375&v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\"  />\r\n<img alt=\"A still from the film &#x27;500 Miles&#x27;: the image portrays a grandfather with his two grandsons standing together on a ship out at sea\" src=\"/media/czjd4jkm/500-miles.png?width=375&amp;v=1dcf8bd9fcb9920\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" class=\"video-block__img js-video-with-facade-img\" /></picture>\n                </a>\n            <iframe title=\"Embedded video\" class=\"embed__source js-video-with-facade-iframe\" data-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/PugHo6Pm51I?autoplay=1\" allow=\"autoplay\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--6\" data-area-col-span=\"6\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"group group--h-align-left group--v-gutter-default\">\n        \n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--12\" data-area-col-span=\"12\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"text-block shared-styles js-add-wrapper\" data-wrap=\"table\" data-wrap-class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <h2 class=\"heading--h3\">500 Miles</h2>\n<p>Two brothers run away to avoid being split up by their separating parents, embarking on an epic trip from Yorkshire to Ireland’s west coast, to reunite with their estranged grandfather. On a 500-mile journey across land and sea, they survive on their smarts, charm and the kindness of strangers.</p>\n<p>Stars Deirdre Monaghan,&nbsp;Loré Adewusi, Dexter Sol Ansell<br><em>(Certification 12A)</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.sevenrooms.com/reservations/oscarbarandrestaurant?default_date=2026-07-25&amp;default_time=3:00PM&amp;client_id=256b5a7fc0bc1586eb4b87f2e03d1fd7309c39a81866422a8691e41fd6950da438110b5a11a2684943b1897abf70a0011b252871140c915ab808aa51bd35cfe7\" target=\"_blank\" data-anchor=\"?default_date=2026-07-25&amp;default_time=3:00PM&amp;client_id=256b5a7fc0bc1586eb4b87f2e03d1fd7309c39a81866422a8691e41fd6950da438110b5a11a2684943b1897abf70a0011b252871140c915ab808aa51bd35cfe7\">CHARLOTTE STREET HOTEL - SATURDAY 25TH JULY, 3PM</a></li>\n</ul>\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"section__media\">\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n    </div>\n</main>\n\n\n    <footer>\n        \n\n<div class=\"pre-footer\">\n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                    <section class=\"section section--theme-none section--halign-center section--valign-middle section--top-padding-default section--bottom-padding-default section--width-default section--gutter-default section--v-gutter-default section--stacked-v-gutter-match-desktop section--size-sized-by-content section--has-decorative-border\"\n                        >\n                        <div class=\"section__content\">\n                            <div class=\"constrain constrain--default\">\n                                <div class=\"section__layout\">\n                                    \n\n\n\n\n\n                <div class=\"block column-span column-span--3\" data-area-col-span=\"3\" style=\"--blockStackingOrder:0\">\n                    \n\n\n\n    <div class=\"image-block image-block--no-background image-block--override-height image-block--crop-square\" style=\